## 2.1 Data

Table 1 lists the datasets and the role of each. The diaries come from three national time-use surveys of the HETUS family: Spain 2009-10 (INE, 2011), Italy 2013-14 (ISTAT, 2016) and the UK 2014-15 (Sullivan and Gershuny, 2023). Together they deliver 77,057 diaries and 2,096,043 episodes. All three are anonymised microdata released by their publishers; no data were collected from people for this study.

